<article class="env-definition" id="06JP">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/06JP">Definition <span data-tag="06JP">90.19.1</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{F}$ be a category cofibered in groupoids over $\mathcal C_\Lambda $. Let $x' \to x$ be a morphism in $\mathcal{F}$ lying over $A' \to A$. The kernel </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \text{Inf}(x'/x) = \mathop{\mathrm{Ker}}(\text{Aut}_{A'}(x') \to \text{Aut}_ A(x))  \]
</div>
  <p> is the <em>group of infinitesimal automorphisms of $x'$ over $x$</em>. </p>
</article>